# Cloud Architecture Code Examples

Here are practical code examples demonstrating secure, scalable multi-tenant SaaS architectures:

## 1. Terraform Infrastructure (Multi-Tenant VPC)

```hcl
# main.tf - Multi-tenant VPC with isolation
resource "aws_vpc" "tenant_vpc" {
  cidr_block           = var.tenant_cidr
  enable_dns_hostnames = true

  tags = {
    Name        = "${var.environment}-${var.tenant_id}-vpc"
    Environment = var.environment
    Tenant      = var.tenant_id
  }
}

resource "aws_subnet" "public" {
  count             = 2
  vpc_id            = aws_vpc.tenant_vpc.id
